    return sxy / weight - (sx / weight) * (sy / weight) if weight > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Composition-level neutral charge-transfer stabilization proxy from atomic ionization energies and affinities.","name":"atomic_charge_transfer_capacity","source":"def feature(s):
