    return (4.0 * pi / 3.0) * spheres / volume if volume > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Rotationally invariant anisotropy of the occupied covalent-bond direction tensor: one minus three times its smallest normalized eigenvalue.","name":"covalent_bond_direction_anisotropy","source":"def feature(s):
    if not s:
