                    total += w * (en[i] - en[j]) ** 2
                    weight += w
    return total / (2.0 * variance * weight) if weight > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Screened pair interaction of neutral, atomic-electronegativity/hardness-equilibrated charges; not a fitted energy model.","name":"screened_atomic_charge_contact","source":"def feature(s):
