        if 0 <= i < n and 0 <= j < n and 1e-8 < d <= 1.3 * near[i]:
            coordination[i] += occ[j]
    return sum(occ[i] * coordination[i] for i in range(n)) / weight"},{"description":"Coefficient of variation across sites of occupancy-weighted adaptive first-shell coordination.","name":"adaptive_coordination_heterogeneity","source":"def feature(s):
