    return 4.0 * pi * total / (3.0 * weight * v) if weight > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Occupancy-weighted mean of each site's shortest distance divided by the pair's summed covalent radii.","name":"nearest_reduced_distance_mean","source":"def feature(s):
