            value += occ[i] * ((loads[i] - targets[i]) / targets[i]) ** 2
            total += occ[i]
    return value / total if total > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Atomic electronegativity-equalization stabilization magnitude from ionization energies and electron affinities, in eV per supported atom.","name":"atomic_charge_transfer_gain","source":"def feature(s):
