    return hetero / total if total > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Group 14–17 octet-coordination deficit using a smooth distance-based bond-order surrogate; not an oxidation-state assignment.","name":"p_block_smooth_bond_deficit","source":"def feature(s):
