                numerator += w * a * c
                denominator += 0.5 * w * (a * a + c * c)
    return numerator / denominator if denominator > 1e-12 else 0.0"},{"description":"Radius-scaled short-contact load between electronegative atoms, emphasizing molecular-anion bonding.","name":"electronegative_short_bond_load","source":"def feature(s):
