                    value += fraction * max(0.0, count)
    return value / total if total > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Mean squared electronegativity difference across short contacts, weighted by occupancy and inverse squared distance.","name":"short_bond_electronegativity_contrast","source":"def feature(s):
