    return sqrt(sum(weights[i] * (coordination[i] - mean) ** 2 for i in range(n)) / total)"},{"description":"Mean squared short-contact deficit relative to 18-group for period 2–3 group 14–17 sites; a geometric heuristic, not oxidation state.","name":"light_p_block_contact_deficit","source":"def feature(s):
