    return sqrt(max(0.0, squared / weight - (value / weight) ** 2))"},{"description":"Mean ratio of the nearest distance beyond 1.25 times the minimum to the minimum; uses the 6 Å search boundary if absent and caps ratios at three.","name":"mean_first_shell_isolation","source":"def feature(s):
