    return same / total - sum((x / mass) ** 2 for x in counts.values()) if total > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Fraction of short contacts from electronegative sites to neighbors at least 0.5 less electronegative.","name":"anion_heteropolar_contact_fraction","source":"def feature(s):
