    return sum(occ[i] * nearest[i] for i in range(n) if isfinite(nearest[i])) / total if total > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Occupied-site standard deviation of minimum covalent-radius-normalized contact lengths.","name":"std_reduced_nearest_contact","source":"def feature(s):
