    return 4.0 * pi * total / (3.0 * weight * v) if weight > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Mean occupied-neighbor coordination with a linear covalent-distance taper from full weight at one radius sum to zero at 1.35.","name":"mean_covalent_contact_coordination","source":"def feature(s):
