    return sqrt(max(0.0, variance)) / mean if mean > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Occupancy-weighted standard deviation of short-contact distances normalized by covalent-radius sums.","name":"short_bond_distance_ratio_dispersion","source":"def feature(s):
