    return contrast / (contacts * baseline) - 1.0 if contacts > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Short-contact mean positive one-electron Coulomb stabilization minus atomic charge-transfer cost.","name":"coulomb_assisted_charge_transfer_drive","source":"def feature(s):
