        r = (p.get(e) or {}).get('covalent_radius_A')
        if x is not None and x > 0 and r is not None and r > 0:
            total += x * r * r * r
            weight += x
    return 4.0 * pi * total / (3.0 * weight * v) if weight > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Occupied-site mean relative gap between first and second periodic neighbors, exposing isolated short bonds; missing second neighbors use the 6-A search boundary.","name":"nearest_bond_isolation_gap","source":"def feature(s):
