    return sum(o[i] * near[i] ** 3 for i in range(n) if isfinite(near[i])) / (weight * v) if weight > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"First-shell weighted covariance between reduced bond extension and absolute electronegativity contrast.","name":"polarity_strain_covariance","source":"def feature(s):
