        total += w * (1.0 - exp(-0.25 * (x - y) ** 2))
        norm += w
    return total / norm if norm > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Unlike-element contact fraction minus its random-composition expectation.","name":"chemical_mixing_excess","source":"def feature(s):
