        total += occ[i] * occ[j] * exp(2.0 - 2.0 * u * u)
    return total / (2.0 * z)"},{"description":"Occupancy-weighted H3 valence-electron count per cubic angstrom.","name":"valence_electron_density","source":"def feature(s):
